scapes me, my memory's clear."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "So if you want to remember all that\u2019s fine,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Open your eyes wide, like a bird in flight."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Visual memory is a treasure so bright,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And together, we\u2019ll remember it day and night."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}